```{=html}
<div class="papers">
<% for (const item of items) { %>
  <div class="paper" <%= metadataAttrs(item) %>>
    <span class="paper-year"><%= item.date ? new Date(item.date).getUTCFullYear() : '' %></span>
    <div>
      <a class="paper-title" href="<%= item.path %>"><%= item.title %></a>
      <span class="paper-meta"><%= item.author %> &middot; <em><%= item.journal %></em></span>
    </div>
  </div>
<% } %>
</div>
```
